flowchart LR
  S[Scope + threat model] --> D[Discover / import]
  D --> V[Validate evidence]
  V --> T[Triage + accept]
  T --> P[Generate patch]
  P --> X[Verify exact patch]
  X --> H[Human review]
  H --> C[Merge / deploy / revalidate / close]
  V --> Q[Disproved / needs context]
  X -->|Failed or incomplete| P
  H -->|Changes requested| P
